      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALDEBARAN DENBAY (5) is in a purple patch of form having put two wins together in this grade at Kilmore, last week leading from a similar draw before scoring by 8m. Big chance to land the hat trick. THE CHOOK (6) continued her good form when runner-up to ALDEBARAN DENBAY last start. Draws on the outside of that rival again but does own a good record at this circuit and distance. BET BET HOTSHOT (1) won two back at Kilmore before a fourth from a wide barrier last time. Has drawn to advantage and should get his chance from there. Last-start placegetter CADENCE LANE (9) may need some luck from this barrier but does look close to a win. HOLD THAT MAGIC (11) continues a run of second row draws but is suited returning to the venue that has produced both career wins.",
